{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳瀅日前把握陽光充沛的好天氣，帶著兩隻愛犬一同前往沙灘享受日光浴與海風。她事後在社交平台大晒多張打卡靚相，穿上一件頭泳衣搭配熱褲登場，造型充滿健康活力！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了陳瀅的熱辣身材成為全場焦點外，她與愛犬的溫馨互動亦吸引了不少網民的注意。相中可見，她將愛犬放入精緻的編織袋中「袋著走」，而狗仔亦非常乖巧地露出小頭與腳仔，模樣極之可愛。陳瀅更跪在沙灘墊上溫柔地撫摸愛犬，畫面相當溫馨有愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0413be80-6e41-47ca-9102-ef4493fc5572.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jtQ6pVp5f21790909477.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0413be80-6e41-47ca-9102-ef4493fc5572.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a0664708-7525-4bb5-830e-67be0dbfb754.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026xqv94MotQD1790909476.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a0664708-7525-4bb5-830e-67be0dbfb754.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相片曝光後，一眾網民紛紛留言大讚：「身材keep得好好」、「狗狗好可愛呀」。同時也有不少貼心的粉絲提醒女神注意防暑，留言表示：「休假快樂！不過太熱啦，記住飲多啲水。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T03:18:41.400615+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}